OL,3,GNEWSACouple host Nepal fundraiser after
OL,4,Arelatives' homes destroyed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple whose relatives survived the
OL,7,Fdeadly floods in Nepal last month are
OL,8,Fplanning to fundraise for victims of
OL,9,Fthe disaster with a donated clothes
OL,10,Fsale.
OL,12,FMegan and Bikrant Maharjan tied the
OL,13,Fknot last year in Trishuli Bazar, one
OL,14,Fof the towns devastated by the floods
OL,15,Funleashed by an avalanche of rock and
OL,16,Fice on the Nepal-Tibet border.
OL,18,FAbout 1,400 people have died in the
OL,19,Fdisaster and 6,150 people remain
OL,20,Fmissing, according to official data.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,333,330,200,160,0,100
