OL,3,GNEWSACouple host Nepal fundraiser after
OL,4,Arelatives' homes destroyed
OL,5,
OL,6,FMegan, director of Ashridge Manor
OL,7,FGarden Centre in Wokingham where the
OL,8,Fsale will be held on Sunday, said:
OL,9,F"We've been absolutely overwhelmed by
OL,10,Fthe support we've had from our
OL,11,Fcommunities around us."
